WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.470
Tower Hamlets is a borough
in inner east London.

2
00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:10.550
In the 2021 Census, 47.4 per cent
of its people were aged 20 to 39.

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.930
Across England, 26.3 per cent.

4
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.770
In Richmond upon Thames,
in outer south-west London,

5
00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:20.010
it was 22.9 per cent.

6
00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:25.910
From 2011 to 2021, Tower Hamlets grew
faster than any other local authority in

7
00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:27.070
England.

8
00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:30.130
So who moves in, and who leaves?

9
00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:32.850
In this mission, you'll
read London's Census data,

10
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:37.290
from whole-city age pyramids
down to tiny output areas.

11
00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:40.510
Then you'll follow London's
shift from docks to finance,

12
00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:44.110
and compare quality of
life across the city.

13
00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.230
Your mission: find out who
moves into Tower Hamlets,

14
00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.850
and who leaves.
